WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.370
This is H2F Trainer.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:13.330
Your H2F program, all in one place. Your workout, rank, tips and week, on one screen.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:29.470
Train with a plan. Get a full H2F week, then run it as stations, as a circuit, or follow a multi-week program.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:41.950
Plan ruck and run routes that follow real trails. Then track them live with GPS.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:49.700
Tap where it hurts, and get exercises and a recovery week.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.370
Work out your AFT score.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.880
Sleep on a schedule.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.940
Fuel like it counts.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:06.670
Reset your mind.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:10.710
And know your why.

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:17.720
Earn your rank. Nine tiers, from Recruit to Legend.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:25.070
Earn ribbons for real work. Then earn them again.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:31.420
Bring your squad. Share your week, and send the app by QR code.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.360
One app for every part of H2F.

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:43.660
H2F Trainer. Train like it matters.
